<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in the</p>
<p>Argentine Apertura soccer championship at the weekend.</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	    6    Huracan			0</p>
<p> Racing Club	     0    Deportivo Espannol	 0</p>
<p> Lanus		     2    Newell's Old Boys	  0</p>
<p> Platense		  2    Banfield		     0</p>
<p> Colon		     2    Velez Sarsfield	    1</p>
